      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EDGE ELEVEN (1) finished sixth last start over 2130m at Gloucester Park, beaten 20 metres, after a modest fourth at Narrogin the run prior. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meets a similar quality field and is good enough to win a race of this calibre. ELQUESTRO (8) recorded a strong performance last time when he battled on bravely to just miss out over 2100m at Bunbury. Drawn to enjoy an economical run and might sweat on the sprint lane. Meets a comparable field and he can take care of this line-up. FRONTMAN (2) was beaten 6 metres on debut last start over 2130m at Gloucester Park. Has plenty of scope for improvement. TEN DEEP (3) did a good job to wind up in third on debut two back then was checked broke in the run and finished eighth, beaten 35 metres, at the latest appearance over 2100m at Bunbury. Will enjoy a nice run from this far more favourable starting position. Won't find this any harder and she can bounce back.",
